Terminal (static)

Primary terminal display.

Properties:
  Width, Height               - Display dimensions
  DefaultFg, DefaultBg        - Default colors (r,g,b)
  ColorFg, ColorBg            - Current colors (r,g,b)
  CursorX, CursorY            - Cursor position

Methods:
  SetChar(x, y, c, fg, bg)    - Set character at position
  GetChar(x, y)               - Get character at position
  SetRow(y, text, startX, fg, bg)    - Write text horizontally
  SetColumn(x, text, startY, fg, bg) - Write text vertically
  GetRow(y)                   - Read entire row as string
  GetColumn(x)                - Read entire column as string
  Clear()                     - Clear display
  GetForegroundColor(x, y)    - Get fg color at position
  GetBackgroundColor(x, y)    - Get bg color at position
  ResetColors()               - Reset to default colors
  Write(text)                 - Write text at cursor
  WriteLine(text)             - Write text with newline